62. INTERVIEW CODING PROBLEM — COPY OF VALUE
Predict the output:
let original = 100;
let copy = original;

original = 200;

console.log(original);
console.log(copy);
Output:
200
100
Interview explanation:
The assignment copied the current value of original into copy. Reassigning original later does not change copy.
